<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dollar General cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dollar General cut on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Wayne Hood downgraded his rating on Dollar General Corp to hold from buy due to the stock's valuation, his office said.</p>
<p>-- Hood made no changes to his earnings estimates, his office said.</p>
</text>
